{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/25319d82117e6e1b108d68e4333dfd69.poster.avif?t=1757445889\" width=800 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/25319d82117e6e1b108d68e4333dfd69.webm?t=1757445889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005500/extras/25319d82117e6e1b108d68e4333dfd69.mp4?t=1757445889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRU</strong> is a first-person shooter that takes inspiration from early 2000's FPS games, creating an uncompromising setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up with several different weapons you find along your journey, fight a multitude of  hellish enemies, and attempt to restore order in a world long gone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An intense shooter experience, with an arsenal of heavy-hitting weapons and nightmarish enemies;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, dash and make your way across several handcrafted and highly detailed levels;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmosphere composed of an early 2000's aesthetic, with strong attention to visuals and sound design. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRU</strong> contains flashing lights which may not be suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005500?t=1757445889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005500?t=1757445889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i